# Acronym Update Policy

When adding new acronyms to `acronyms.json`:

- Append new acronyms at the end of the file.
- Add new acronyms in groups of exactly 10 per batch.
- Before staging or committing, verify no newly added acronym key duplicates any existing key.
- If a batch has more than 10 new acronyms, split it into multiple appended groups of 10.
- Keep acronym keys uppercase and definitions concise.
